Grade [TP304] [TP304L] [TP316] [TP316L] [_____]] [<RID>ASTM A789/A789M</RID>, [seamless] [welded], Grade [S32760] [_____]] 
with nominal size and wall thickness [in accordance with Pipe Schedule] [_____]. </TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Stainless Steel Joints</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Join stainless steel piping by [threaded couplings] [welded fittings] [flanges] [crimping couplings].  Join tubing 
using [crimping couplings] [compression] [_____] fittings.  Provide dielectric fittings or isolation joints between 
