<DTA TYPE="STRING">Closed loop</DTA>
         </CEL>
         <CEL>
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Water only; glycols and oils are not acceptable; NSF 61 approved corrosion inhibitors are acceptable.  Integrate cooling water system to the Ozone Generator skid.</DTA>
         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="93.75">
